2. AI service names and logos / 各家 AI 的名称和图标

   The app shows the names and logos of the AI services you can choose from,
   only to tell you which service a key belongs to. They are trademarks of
   their respective owners; GetNewWord is not affiliated with, sponsored by
   or endorsed by any of them:
   应用里列出可选 AI 服务的名称和图标，只用来标明一个 Key 属于哪家服务。它们是各自
   公司的商标，GetNewWord 与这些公司没有隶属、赞助或背书关系：

   - 智谱 / Zhipu (GLM): Zhipu AI
   - DeepSeek: DeepSeek
   - 通义千问 / Qwen: Alibaba Cloud
   - Kimi: Moonshot AI
   - 豆包 / Doubao: ByteDance
   - OpenAI: OpenAI
   - Gemini: Google
   - Claude: Anthropic
   - OpenRouter: OpenRouter

   Anki and the AnkiConnect add-on are not bundled: the app downloads them from
   their official sources only when you click install.
   Anki 和 AnkiConnect 插件不在安装包里，只在你点安装时从官方地址下载。
